DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nAdam Ferrara LIVE at Chicago Improv\nAdam Ferrara 
	brings his acclaimed stand-up comedy to the Chicago Improv in Schaumburg f
	or a night of laughs. Known for his sharp wit and hilarious storytelling\,
	 Ferrara is a veteran comedian and actor who never fails to deliver an unf
	orgettable performance. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\n
	Time: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K120B\, Sc
	haumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nSeating: Ge
	neral Admission (first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink mi
	nimum per person \nAbout Adam Ferrara\nAdam Ferrara is a New York-based st
	and-up comedian and actor best known for his roles on the TV series “Rescu
	e Me” and as a co-host on “Top Gear USA.” His comedy blends personal story
	telling with sharp observations about life\, family\, and relationships. F
	errara has appeared on numerous late-night shows and is a favorite on the 
	comedy club circuit. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, storytelling-driven stand
	-up comedy\nHilarious observations about life and relationships\nIntimate 
	comedy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull food and drink service (2-i
	tem minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nGeneral admission seati
	ng — arrive early for best seats\n\nVenue Information\nChicago Improv is l
	ocated inside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\, one of the premier comed
	y clubs in the Chicago area. The venue offers a full menu and bar service 
	in an intimate showroom setting perfect for live comedy. \nTicket Informat
	ion\nTickets start at $29.49. Available through Ticketmaster and VividSeat
	s. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post con
	tains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets throug
	h our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subj
	ect to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedy
	calendar.com/event/adam-ferrara-live-at-chicago-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Cal
	endar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/adam-ferrara-live-at-chicago-improv/
