SUMMARY:Alonzo Bodden LIVE at Punch Line Irving
DTSTAMP:20260730T055301Z
DTSTART:20260730T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nAlonzo Bodden is one of America’s most respected stand-up comedians\,
	 best known for winning Season 3 of NBC’s hit reality competition Last Com
	ic Standing. With over 25 years of experience making audiences laugh acros
	s the globe\, Bodden has established himself as a sharp\, intelligent voic
	e in comedy. \nA regular panelist on NPR’s beloved quiz show Wait Wait… Do
	n’t Tell Me!\, Bodden brings a uniquely thoughtful perspective to his stan
	d-up. His comedy blends keen social observation\, political commentary\, a
	nd everyday life experiences — all delivered with a cool\, laid-back style
	 that feels both effortless and razor-sharp. \nBefore comedy\, Bodden work
	ed as a jet mechanic for Lockheed and McDonnell Douglas for nine years — a
	 background that gives his material a grounded\, working-class authenticit
	y. He has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Comedy Central\, and released his
	 own Showtime comedy special. Fans can expect a night of smart\, laugh-out
	-loud comedy that covers everything from pop culture to politics to the ab
	surdities of modern life. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 20
	26\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Irving\n
	Address: 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX 75039\nAge Rest
	riction: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID required\nBeverage Mini
	mum: 2-drink minimum per person\nAdditional Dates: Also performing Fri Jul
	 31 at 7:00 PM and Sat Aug 1 at 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunc
	h Line Irving is one of the Dallas-Fort Worth area’s premier stand-up come
	dy clubs\, located in the heart of the Las Colinas urban center in Irving\
	, Texas. Part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, 
	this venue delivers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere that puts fans clo
	se to the action. \nThe club is situated inside the vibrant Toyota Music F
	actory entertainment complex at 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130 — a de
	stination packed with restaurants\, bars\, and entertainment options. The 
	venue features a full bar\, table seating\, and a dedicated stage designed
	 to maximize the comedy experience. With a capacity that keeps the room fe
	eling personal and energetic\, every seat feels like a great seat. \nParki
	ng is available throughout the Toyota Music Factory complex\, with both su
	rface lots and a parking garage nearby. The venue is easily accessible fro
	m major highways including I-635 and TX-114\, making it convenient for att
	endees coming from Dallas\, Fort Worth\, and surrounding suburbs. \nWhat t
	o Expect\nThis is a solo headlining stand-up comedy show featuring Alonzo 
	Bodden performing his latest material. Expect a full evening of sharp obse
	rvational humor\, political wit\, and storytelling that draws from Bodden’
	s unique life experiences — from his days as an aircraft mechanic to his y
	ears touring the world as a comedian. \nThe show runs approximately 90 min
	utes and is recommended for mature audiences. The intimate club setting at
	 Punch Line Irving means you’ll be close enough to feel every punchline la
	nd. Come ready to laugh\, enjoy a drink\, and experience one of comedy’s m
	ost respected voices live on stage. \nNote: This is an 18+ event. Please b
	ring a valid\, government-issued photo ID. A 2-beverage minimum per person
	 applies. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from $32 – $75 dependin
	g on seating section. General Admission seating starts at $32. Preferred s
	eating options are also available at higher price points. \nPurchase your 
	official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets th
	rough VividSeats with their 100% Buyer Guarantee. \nOfficial TicketsResale
	 Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/alonzo-bodden-l
	ive-at-punch-line-irving/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/alonzo-bodden-live-at-punch-line-irvin
	g/
LOCATION:Punch Line Irving\, 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\,
	 TX\, 75039\, United States Of America
