SUMMARY:Jack Jr. LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DTSTAMP:20260730T055301Z
DTSTART:20260730T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nJack Assadourian Jr. — known on stage simply as Jack Jr. — is a risin
	g star in the stand-up comedy world\, bringing a sharp\, self-deprecating 
	wit and high-energy storytelling to stages across the country. \nBorn and 
	raised in Southern California\, Jack Jr. has built a loyal following throu
	gh his relatable observations about family\, relationships\, and the absur
	dities of everyday life. His comedy is clean enough for a broad audience y
	et edgy enough to keep things exciting. \nHe has performed at top comedy c
	lubs nationwide including Cobb’s Comedy Club in San Francisco and the Ice 
	House in Pasadena\, and is quickly becoming one of the most talked-about n
	ames on the club circuit. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 20
	26\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddr
	ess: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ (2 Be
	verage Minimum per person)\nTicket Prices: $38 – $50 (fees included)\n\nAb
	out the Venue\nPunch Line Houston is one of the premier stand-up comedy cl
	ubs in the South\, located in the heart of downtown Houston at 1204 Caroli
	ne Street. Part of the Live Nation family\, this intimate venue delivers a
	n up-close comedy experience unlike any other in the city. \nThe club feat
	ures a general admission layout with preferred seating options\, giving ev
	ery guest a great view of the stage. The atmosphere is lively and social\,
	 with a full bar and 2-beverage minimum that keeps the energy flowing thro
	ughout the show. \nParking is convenient — valet service is available at m
	ost shows\, and the Green Street garage (located on Clay between Main and 
	Fannin) offers surface and garage parking with skybridge access. The venue
	 is cashless and accepts all major credit cards. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect 
	a high-energy evening of stand-up comedy featuring Jack Jr.’s signature bl
	end of storytelling\, crowd work\, and sharp observational humor. The Thur
	sday night show is a great way to kick off the weekend with laughs. \nDoor
	s open one hour before the show\, so arrive early to grab your seats and e
	njoy a drink before the performance begins. The show typically runs approx
	imately 90 minutes including an opening act. \nNote: Heckling\, cell phone
	 use\, video recording\, and photography are strictly prohibited inside th
	e showroom. Leave large bags and backpacks at home. \nTicket Information\n
	Tickets range from $38 to $50 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes
	). Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (re
	sale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate lin
	ks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycal
	endar.com/event/jack-jr-live-at-punch-line-houston/\n\nFrom Comedy Calenda
	r
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jack-jr-live-at-punch-line-houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\,
	 United States
