SUMMARY:Chris Porter LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - San Francisco
DTSTAMP:20260730T055301Z
DTSTART:20260730T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nChris Porter is a Kansas City-born stand-up comedian known for his ra
	w\, high-energy delivery and razor-sharp storytelling. He first gained nat
	ional attention as a third-place finalist on NBC’s Last Comic Standing Sea
	son 4 in 2006\, and has since built a devoted following through his Comedy
	 Central specials and appearances on Live at Gotham. \nPorter’s comedy is 
	rooted in real life — vivid\, slice-of-life rants that transform everyday 
	frustrations into precision-crafted laughs. His acclaimed hour Ugly and An
	gry cemented his reputation as a fearless\, no-nonsense voice in stand-up\
	, and his follow-up special A Man From Kansas doubled down on that unfilte
	red perspective. His most recent special\, There’s No Money in Babies (202
	3)\, showcases a comedian who keeps evolving while staying unmistakably hi
	mself. \nFans can expect a high-octane night of comedy filled with sharp o
	bservations\, relatable frustrations\, and the kind of honest\, blue-colla
	r humor that has made Porter one of the most respected working comics in t
	he country. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\nShow Time:
	 8:00 PM\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\nAddress: 444 Batt
	ery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Restriction: 18+ (2 Beverage Mi
	nimum)\nTicket Prices: From $29 (General Admission)\n\nAbout the Venue\nTh
	e Punch Line Comedy Club in San Francisco is one of the most storied comed
	y venues on the West Coast. Located at 444 Battery Street in the heart of 
	the Financial District\, the club has been a launching pad for some of the
	 biggest names in comedy since the 1970s. With an intimate capacity of aro
	und 300 seats\, every seat in the house feels close to the stage. \nThe ve
	nue features a classic comedy club layout with tiered seating\, cocktail t
	ables\, and a full bar. The atmosphere is warm and lively — the kind of ro
	om where the energy between performer and audience crackles from the first
	 joke. Parking is available in nearby garages along Battery and Front Stre
	ets\, and the venue is easily accessible via BART (Embarcadero Station) an
	d Muni. \nThe Punch Line is a 18+ venue with a two-drink minimum\, so come
	 ready to settle in\, order a drink\, and enjoy a world-class comedy exper
	ience in one of San Francisco’s most beloved rooms. \nWhat to Expect\nChri
	s Porter’s live show is an experience unlike any other. Known for his rock
	-and-roll energy on stage\, Porter commands the room from the moment he wa
	lks out. His sets are a masterclass in comedic timing — building stories w
	ith precision before landing punchlines that hit hard. \nThis is a solo he
	adlining show\, so expect a full evening of Chris Porter’s signature brand
	 of comedy: honest\, unfiltered\, and deeply funny. Whether you’re a longt
	ime fan or discovering him for the first time\, this is the kind of show y
	ou’ll be talking about for weeks. Doors typically open 60–90 minutes befor
	e showtime\, giving you time to grab a drink and find your seat. \nTicket 
	Information\nTickets start at $29 for General Admission (18+ / 2 Beverage 
	Minimum). Preferred Premium seating is also available at higher price poin
	ts. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (
	resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/ev
	ent/chris-porter-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-san-francisco/\n\nFrom Com
	edy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chris-porter-live-at-punch-line-comedy
	-club-san-francisco/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San 
	Francisco\, California\, 94111\, United States Of America
