DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nCarrot Top LIVE at Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hotel 
	and Casino\nScott “Carrot Top” Thompson\, one of Las Vegas’s most beloved 
	and longest-running comedy headliners\, brings his outrageous prop comedy 
	show to the Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hotel and Casino on July 30\, 2026. K
	nown for his wild red hair\, boundless energy\, and trunk full of hilariou
	s props\, Carrot Top delivers a one-of-a-kind comedy experience that has m
	ade him a Las Vegas institution. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 30
	\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hotel and Casin
	o\nAddress: 3900 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89119\nAge Requirement:
	 18+ Event \nAbout Carrot Top\nScott “Carrot Top” Thompson is one of the m
	ost recognizable comedians in the world\, famous for his prop-based comedy
	\, outrageous physical humor\, and signature red hair. He has been a Las V
	egas headliner for over two decades\, performing thousands of shows at the
	 Luxor. His act blends pop culture commentary\, inventive props\, and high
	-energy performance that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \n
	What to Expect\n\nHilarious prop comedy with hundreds of custom-made gags\
	nPop culture parody and sharp observational humor\nHigh-energy performance
	 with non-stop laughs\nAudience interaction and surprise moments\nA Las Ve
	gas comedy institution with decades of experience\nApproximately 90 minute
	s of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\nThe Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hote
	l and Casino is an intimate theater located on the Las Vegas Strip\, offer
	ing excellent sightlines and a comfortable setting for comedy shows. The L
	uxor features world-class dining\, gaming\, and entertainment options befo
	re and after the show. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximat
	ely $30 to $75. This is an 18+ event. Tickets are available through Ticket
	master (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Ticke
	ts \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purch
	ase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are fin
	al. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry
	.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/carrot-top-live-at-atrium-showroom-a
	t-luxor-hotel-and-casino-2/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/carrot-top-live-at-atrium-showroom-at-
	luxor-hotel-and-casino-2/
