DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nUpDating LIVE at Nevermore Hall\nUpDating is the f
	irst-of-its-kind viral sensation live dating comedy show where two real si
	ngles go on a blind date right before a live audience. It’s part comedy sh
	ow\, part social experiment\, and 100% entertaining. Don’t miss this uniqu
	e experience coming to Nevermore Hall in Baltimore on July 30\, 2026! \nEv
	ent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM ET\nVenue: Nev
	ermore Hall\nAddress: 20 Market Place\, Baltimore\, MD\nAge Requirement: C
	heck venue for details \nAbout UpDating\nUpDating is a groundbreaking live
	 comedy show that combines the excitement of a blind date with the energy 
	of a live comedy performance. Two real singles meet for the first time on 
	stage in front of a live audience\, creating an unpredictable and hilariou
	s experience. The show has gone viral for its authentic\, unscripted momen
	ts and laugh-out-loud comedy. \nWhat to Expect\n\nReal blind dates happeni
	ng live on stage\nUnscripted\, authentic comedy moments\nAudience particip
	ation and interaction\nA unique blend of reality TV and live comedy\nHilar
	ious commentary and hosting\nAn unforgettable night of entertainment\n\nVe
	nue Information\nNevermore Hall is a unique entertainment venue located at
	 20 Market Place in Baltimore\, MD\, offering an intimate setting perfect 
	for live comedy and special events. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at
	 $72. Secure your seats now before they sell out! \nOfficial Tickets\nResa
	le Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if y
	ou purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales
	 are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required f
	or entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/updating-live-at-nevermore-h
	all/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
