DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Nate Bargatze\nNate Barg
	atze is the #1 earning comedian in the world according to Pollstar\, and h
	e holds the record for the biggest one-year gross by a comedy performer in
	 history. \nA Grammy Award winner and Emmy-nominated comedian\, Nate hoste
	d the 77th Primetime Emmy Awards on CBS — the highest-rated Emmys in four 
	years. His Netflix special Your Friend\, Nate Bargatze was in the global t
	op 10 for two weeks and won the Grammy for Best Comedy Album. \nHe is also
	 a New York Times #1 bestselling author\, a game show host on ABC/Hulu\, a
	nd stars in the Sony Pictures comedy The Breadwinner. His clean\, relatabl
	e humor about family\, marriage\, and everyday life has made him one of th
	e most beloved comedians of his generation. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\
	, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: PPG Paints
	 Arena\, 1001 Fifth Ave\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15219\nTour: Big Dumb Eyes World
	 Tour\nShow Duration: Approximately 2 hours (including openers) \nAbout th
	e Venue\nPPG Paints Arena is Pittsburgh’s premier indoor arena\, home to t
	he Pittsburgh Penguins and one of the top entertainment venues in the regi
	on. \nThe arena seats approximately 18\,387 guests for concerts and comedy
	 events\, with multiple seating tiers offering excellent sightlines from e
	very section. Concessions\, bars\, and premium club areas are available th
	roughout the venue. \nParking is available in multiple garages surrounding
	 the arena. The venue is easily accessible via I-376 and is steps from the
	 Pittsburgh Light Rail system. Arrive early to beat the crowds and find yo
	ur seats. \nWhat to Expect\nNate Bargatze’s Big Dumb Eyes World Tour is a 
	full arena comedy experience — polished\, hilarious\, and completely famil
	y-friendly. \nExpect multiple opening acts before Nate takes the stage for
	 his headline set. His storytelling about his family\, his dad\, and the a
	bsurdity of everyday life is delivered with perfect timing and genuine war
	mth. \nThis is one of the hottest comedy tickets of 2026 — Nate has been b
	reaking venue attendance records across the country on this tour. \nTicket
	 Information\nTickets range from $49 – $150 depending on seating and avail
	ability. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedyc
